      "target_gain_pct": 0.0,
      "max_regression_pct": -3.0,
      "zero_alloc_expected": true,
      "zero_alloc_probe": "GorillaDecoder is structurally allocation-free: GorillaDecoder.init(bytes, num_points) holds no allocator and decodePoint cannot allocate (gorilla.zig lines 333-347, 442). The decode loop in the scenario body is therefore zero-alloc by construction. Note: TrackingAllocator.alloc_count reported per-sample will be non-zero because the encoder fixture allocation (initForPoints + getCompressedData) happens inside the same run() callback that the framework wraps. To assert decoder zero-alloc, separate the fixture build into the scenario user_data setup or invoke with --no-track."
    },
